{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "01d735582ed6389ebd094bdb521f243a380b5ead2ecd24467b623019bbefb997", "ja": "（衣装合わせをしていた麗花が、衣装のまま帰って\nしまった……。すぐに戻ってくるよう頼んだが……）", "zh": "（丽花正在试装，结果居然就直接穿回去了……\n于是我请她快点回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "23c1fe4ec22be1ec1de1d8822f15f862aab00d9c53175b84b0d51f7699febcf3", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nごめんなさい、私ったら家まで着て帰っちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n对不起，我居然把服装穿回家了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "306cd9a7ed9dc11e03a3bca0bea556373e207e8ce8fd008907674e958c41caa5", "ja": "あ、麗花！　よかった、戻ってきてくれて……。\nビックリしたよ。", "zh": "啊，丽花！太好了，你回来了……\n真是吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a1226616d2f740bdb81cc5f441349a4fe820568f998a160b4df7860c25405537", "ja": "けど、まさか家まで帰ってるとは思わなかったよ。\nそれくらい、着心地がよかったって事か？", "zh": "不过，我真没想到你会直接穿回家。\n那套服装穿起来有那么舒适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "0c3ea4ee39e33be5259940dc544f78a5c4af4ff4734ae8c1c28a4890dcc947da", "ja": "はい、とっても♪　家にお母さんが来てたんですけど、\n「その服どうしたの？」って言われちゃいました。", "zh": "是啊，非常舒适♪我妈妈刚好来我家，\n就问我怎么穿成这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "98535122c14aa3778be9c1a8928a05d15e031ca9ea33fa3ae1a62030fad64f59", "ja": "次の衣装だよって言ったら、「ちょっと着てもいい？」\nって。でも、「ごめんね」って断っちゃいました！", "zh": "我说这是下次表演要穿的，她就问说可不可以借她穿。\n不过，我跟她说对不起，拒绝她了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "9c53205e3be1ca45074e3756befcae99a3a6ee5ef58a14c82071da64d15d1120", "ja": "ちょっとくらい、いいかな？って思ったんですけど……\nやっぱり、私だけの衣装にしておきたいなー、なんて♪", "zh": "虽然我原本也觉得只穿一下应该还好……\n但还是希望这套服装是我专属的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1cbbbca8b51a0079d042821df86640b020ad98cbb3898889c5bdca8faeb03995", "ja": "はは、そうか。そんなに気に入ってくれたなら、\n用意した甲斐があったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。看到你这么喜欢，\n也不枉费我替你准备了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "d79a6ed2e35ee3fc13e5b097db2ac8fce494cae4e362578863f2b1986a433fca", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nどうですか？　似合うと思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你觉得呢？这套服装适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0eb922ee32b49026aab9f84c5b7a8b17878198bcd4caf66e2b741211c5b011b2", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってると思う。可愛いよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得很适合你，很可爱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "044846485640cf8afe6c40848dbcf32f68701466be0f4c93c9e3acc94b964b61", "ja": "えへへ♪　{$P$}さんも、\nそのスーツ、とっても似合ってますよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪{$P$}先生，\n你身上穿的西装也很适合喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "323fbd68074d505537fd0f0288404bc896b486f9c4e2ec19641779462e565858", "ja": "ザ・普通って感じで、すごく素敵です♪", "zh": "感觉非常普通呢，很棒喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
