{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0054_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "4da6324ebfc03c5bb30964debe922b2c7fcc754486a6d78b75b76a8d90651637", "ja": "お返しに、今度{$P$}さんに\n似合いそうな服、あげちゃいますね！", "zh": "下次换我送很适合\n{$P$}先生的衣服当作回礼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
